/-!
# The staged presentation with the chain's first places at the family's orientations

Manuscript `diophantine_zq.tex`, Proposition `ex:arith-moving-character` (tex 2729–2737: the
moving character has value `1 + t` at a chosen orientation above every graph prime; tex 2778–2795:
it is inverted by the conjugation), tex 4142–4146 (the two places of each step above the unused
prime) and tex 4255–4280 (the orientations), on lane RC32's `StagedPresentation`
(`CommonCoordinate19Staged.lean`).

`StagedPresentation` carries two ELLIOT fields on the family's exponent: `xiFrob` (value `1` at
the Frobenius of the first place of each index) and `xiConj` (anticyclotomy). For the genuine
family character (lane RC0's `GenuineFamilyMovingCharacter`) both are derived here:

* `xi_orient_at`, `xi_orient` (PROVED): at a place that is the family's orientation above a graph
  prime `q`, the family's exponent has value `1` at the Frobenius (the family's `orient_one`,
  through a local arithmetic Frobenius lift, `urFactor_spec`, `locMap_compat`);
* **`OrientedPresentation C D Fam x G`**: the fields of `StagedPresentation` for
  `Ψ = G.toFamily`, without `xiFrob` and `xiConj`, with the pin `orientPl` (the first place of the
  `i`-th step is the family's orientation above the `i`-th unused prime; tex 2733–2735,
  4275–4277) and `hpidx` (every index is the index of a step: a formalization requirement, the
  text's chain has one index per unused prime);
* **`OrientedPresentation.xiFrob`** (PROVED from `orient_one`), **`OrientedPresentation.xiConj`**
  (PROVED for `k < 0` and exact moving supports: lane E1's `xiConj_family'`, with no print; `K`
  totally complex and `[K : ℚ] = 2` from `K = ℚ(√k)`) and **`OrientedPresentation.toStaged`**
  (definition): the staged presentation.

Kinds: definitions and PROVED; the fields carry their kinds.
-/

noncomputable section

namespace ZInQ.Manuscript.RC.Wiring

open NumberField IsDedekindDomain TensorProduct
open Matrix Filter ZInQ.Manuscript ZInQ.Manuscript.RC ZInQ.Manuscript.RC.Central
  ZInQ.Contrib.CloudB3RC53 ZInQ.Contrib.CloudB3RC53.CommonCoordinate
open ZInQ.Manuscript.RC.SelmerComplex ZInQ.Contrib.CloudB3RC53.UnramifiedComplex
  ZInQ.Contrib.CloudB3RC53.RankCounts
